<!-- ===================== TITLE ===================== -->
<p class="title">Payroll AI Capstone</p>
<p class="subtitle">System Architecture Design</p>
<p class="meta">Detailed architecture of a microservice payroll workspace with AI-assisted review</p>
<p class="meta">Version 1.0 &nbsp;|&nbsp; October 2026</p>
<br><br>
<table>
  <tr><th colspan="2">Contents</th></tr>
